#  Tutorial

https://testautomationu.applitools.com/performance-and-load-testing/

Performance and load testing is vital to ensure the websites 
and applications you are delivering are fast and reliable. In this course, you’ll learn some tools and techniques to make sure your apps are ready for success.

Lessons will cover:

What is performance and load testing
Find performance issues in web sites
Performance testing on mobile
Tools for load testing back-end services
How to design and execute effective load tests
